{"nodes": [{"id": "plan_refactor_xstate_explicit_error_states_a1_finding_a1", "label": "Finding A1 \u2014 Explicit Error States refactor", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "plan/refactor-xstate-explicit-error-states-a1.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "plan_refactor_xstate_explicit_error_states_a1_explicit_error_state_pattern", "label": "Explicit Error States Pattern (XState)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "plan/refactor-xstate-explicit-error-states-a1.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Convertire 3 macchine XState da pattern context.error (string | null) a stati di errore espliciti. Rende il comportamento UX deterministico da state.matches() invece che da context.error !== null. Elimina sub-stati nascosti in flag di contesto. Migliora debugging (single-check vs multi-step inference) e testabilit\u00e0."}, {"id": "plan_refactor_xstate_explicit_error_states_a1_reactive_viewmodel", "label": "Reactive ViewModel pattern (no dual-write)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "plan/refactor-xstate-explicit-error-states-a1.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Eliminare dual-write anti-pattern in tool-page.machine dove gli assign actions aggiornano sia campi di contesto che viewModel. Sostituire con selettori reactivi puri (buildViewModelFromState) che derivano viewModel da state + context senza side-effect."}], "edges": [{"source": "plan_refactor_xstate_explicit_error_states_a1_finding_a1", "target": "plan_refactor_xstate_explicit_error_states_a1_explicit_error_state_pattern", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "plan/refactor-xstate-explicit-error-states-a1.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plan_refactor_xs